{"unit_id":"y0urday__dsh-arcgis-pro-bridge#card-zh","repo":"y0urday/dsh-arcgis-pro-bridge","commit":"d348e15eb288796dc0414cbf05410003181b2457","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-arcgis-pro-bridge 是把本机 ArcGIS Pro 接入 DSH 的 MCP 插件，通过 bundle 启动 Python MCP 服务并把工具挂到 DSH。它可检测 ArcGIS 环境、检查健康状态与诊断运行时，也能读取工程图层和概况、检查文件地理数据库，并执行 Buffer 与 Clip 空间分析。适合需要在 DSH 中查看或处理 ArcGIS Pro GIS 数据的用户。需要 Windows 和已安装的 ArcGIS Pro；服务可由 uv 启动，也可配置 Python 解释器。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:105","cordis.patch.yml:11","server/arcgis_mcp_server.py:531","server/arcgis_mcp_server.py:797","server/arcgis_mcp_server.py:847"]}
